rogresses.\n\nBut be warned: the longer you survive, the darker it gets. The creatures stalking you are not just fast\u2014they\u2019re relentless. Stick together, or go solo. Hide in shadows or keep moving. Every choice matters, and every second counts.", "short_description": "Welcome to Run Before Dark! A horror game using the well known locomotion of gorilla tag!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tAJTBuPH8qw1TB696ys28eh6cwXWjtbP0ROPnN-dHQw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "W1NGZ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Vh0J-mazHG1X_R13QEcDgKza8Hwtv7ZRLeDLD4gJNJw/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24878043198475509"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307346_4015302792054713_5239565657258931934_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F1DADypbMUMQ7kNvwG5628I&_nc_oc=Adkd89ASQTr9XXBiyZHXfFkMy7si_SHTFjxGH4KLpw-YMpADPYUrdUkrrLLFGC9eniI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs87TMNsxP8nYUMmbYBgvDwu8Vic9AkZIV6Lf0bEGM8ug&oe=69A1AB76"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "